WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Zwimela na zwipuka zwi shanduka nga zwiṱepisi musi fhethu ho khakhisea.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Zwimela zwa u thoma zwi aluwa nga u ṱavhanya, zwi fukedza mavu.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Musi zwenezwo zwimela zwi tshi fa, maṱari na thanda zwazwo zwi fepa mavu.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Mahatsi, mihaṱa na zwiṱaka zwi tshilaho tshifhinga tshilapfu zwi a tevhela, zwa tsireledza vhuṅwe vhutshilo.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Muno Highveld, fhethu ha mahatsi ho takalaho hu nga vha tshitshavha tsha tshifhinga tshilapfu.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Litshani tshipiḓa tsha ḓaka bulasini ḽaṋu tshi aluwe sa vhudzulo ha mupo ho teaho.
